    reg {
        name = "Bus mode register";
        desc = "MMC_BMOD is a bus mode register.

Vendor values: `BMOD_SWR` bit 0, `BURST_INCR` bit 1, `BMOD_DMA_EN` bit 7, `BURST_8` = pbl 2, `BURST_16` = pbl 3. Descriptor flags in memory (`DMA_DES_OWN` bit 31, NEXT_DES bit 4, FIRST_DES bit 3, LAST_DES bit 2) are memory structures, not registers.

Data sheet 12.4.4 MMC_BMOD (offset 0x80, printed page 12-108, `Hi3518EV20X-Hi3516CV200-Datasheet.txt` line 83333).";

        enum MMC_BMOD_pbl_enum {
