    reg {
        name = "UHS extension register";
        desc = "MMC_UHS_REG_EXT is a UHS extension register.

Vendor driver tuning: clk_drv_phase_ctrl (bits 25:23, `DRV_PHASE_MASK` 0x7 << 23) and clk_smpl_phase_ctrl (bits 18:16, `SMPL_PHASE_MASK` 0x7 << 16); the driver writes drive phase 2 (90 degrees) and sample phase 2 on Hi3518EV200 (sample phase 0 on Hi3516CV300 / Hi3519 / Hi3516AV200), then tunes the sample phase for HS200.

